{
  "summary": "H.B. No. 2067 amends Texas Insurance Code Chapter 551 provisions governing declination, cancellation, and nonrenewal notices. It removes request-based language for written statements of reasons, adds a written declination notice requirement for liability and commercial property insurance applications, specifies prospective applicability, and takes effect September 1, 2025.",
